      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RHYTHMIC ENERGY (2) goes very well this trip starting 11 times for four wins and three minors. Hit the frame latest (29.82) when third at Sandown in a Grade 5. Looks well placed and should feature. HOT SUMMER SKY (8) was in the minors two back (16.79) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Form here at this distance is sound. Can measure up this time. WINKING WILLIE (7) has recorded back to back wins, last time scoring at this track over 350m by 2.25 lengths (19.29). Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Hard to fault his recent form and can win again. SONIC DIESEL (1) placed last time out so worth considering.",
